# Oko, Thief of Crowns' +1: "Target artifact or creature loses all abilities and becomes a green Elk creature with base
# power and toughness 3/3." A new creature type replaces the old ones (CR 205.1b; Oko's ruling: it loses all other card
# types and creature types), and the abilities go in layer 6 (CR 613.1f). Bot1's Llanowar Elves, a Creature - Elf Druid,
# is cast on turn 1. On turn 3 it taps for {G} - the positive control: its mana ability works - and that {G} with Mox
# Sapphire's {U} and Mox Pearl's {W} casts Oko, whose +1 makes the Elves an Elk. On turn 5 the Elk is untapped and long
# past summoning sickness, and its "{T}: Add {G}" is no longer offered: it has no abilities. It is a green 3/3 Creature -
# Elk, not an Elf, not a Druid.

